## Data and privacy

- No telemetry is collected by this repository.
- All sample data in `inputs/` uses RFC 1918 / RFC 5737 addressing and `.example`
  domains. No real customer, Cisco-internal, or production data is included.
- Artifacts written to `outputs/` are generated locally from **your** environment and
  may contain sensitive topology information. They are excluded from version control
  by [.gitignore](.gitignore). Review before sharing.

## Generative AI disclosure

The MCP servers under `mcp_servers/` are designed to be driven by AI agents. When you
connect them to a third-party AI platform, your prompts and the data returned by these
tools — which may include firewall policy and addressing information — are processed
under **that platform's** terms and privacy statement, outside the control of this
project. Review those terms before pointing an external model at a production
management plane.
